==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|zle-ort|нагорода}} in the XVII (1696), from {{der|ru|pl|nagroda}}.  <ref>{{R:be:ESBM|нагарода|184|7|naharoda}}</ref><ref>{{R:pl:Bruckner|nagroda|page=353}}</ref><ref>{{R:sla:ESSJa|*nagorda|50|22}}</ref> Remodeled after {{der|ru|cu|[[градъ]], [[градити]]}} later in the XVIII. Falsely believed to derive from unattested {{cog|cu|*награда}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|награ́да}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-награда.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|adə|s=3}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|награ́да}}

# [[reward]] (something of value given in return for an act)
# [[award]]
# [[decoration]]

